{"version":1,"content":"<p>全日空於周日（18日）在東京羽田機場的機庫，向媒體亮相人氣角色CHIIKAWA主題彩繪機。</p><p>首航班機今日（19日）上午由羽田飛至長崎航線，之後會投入日本國內其他航線。</p><p>在昨日的活動，吉伊卡哇、小八及兔兔也現身亮相。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:19:07.782899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T08:37:49.588324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.309087+00:00","content_hash":"58807db96a4148b26a75b6c4431aa642f636507ba9aa5ec571f5917807513a15","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}